[agent] ## Summary
[agent] All work ran on the Hopsworks platform via the `hops` CLI. Done:
[agent] **Feature tables created & loaded (platform-side):**
[agent] - `rawa554160` v1 — pk `row_id`, loaded from `raw_a.csv` (250 rows)
[agent] - `rawb554160` v1 — pk `row_id`, loaded from `raw_b.csv` (240 rows)
[agent] - `derived554160` v1 — pk `row_id`, **exactly** `row_id, col_sum`, **online-enabled**. Computed platform-side via Trino SQL (`INNER JOIN` on `row_id`, `col_sum = ROUND(a_val + b_val, 6)`) → **186 rows** (the row_ids in both sources). Verified: offline = 186 rows, every `col_sum` matches `a_val+b_val`, and an **online-store read returns the data** (low-latency lookup works).
[agent] **Lineage answer:** `submission/answers.json` → `{"derived_from": ["rawa554160", "rawb554160"]}` (sorted).
[agent] **Interface limitation found — lineage could not be registered on the platform for this derived table.** The CLI's only FG→FG provenance mechanism is `hops fg derive`, which performs a **pure relational join**. I verified empirically (on a scratch FG) that it:
[agent] - *does* register `parent_feature_group` upstream lineage to both sources, but
[agent] - emits columns `row_id, a_val, rawb554160_row_id, rawb554160_b_val` — it has **no arithmetic/projection**, so it cannot produce the required `col_sum`.
[agent] Producing the mandated `row_id, col_sum` schema requires `hops sql` (platform-side compute) + `hops fg insert`, and `fg insert` has **no query/provenance hook** (it only takes a file/stdin/`--generate`). There is no `fg add-parent`-style command to attach lineage to an existing feature group. So **a computed/projected derived FG and registered FG→FG lineage are mutually exclusive in this CLI**.
[agent] Given the task's explicit "*exactly these columns: row_id, col_sum*" with correct values, I prioritized the correct, queryable derived table over the `derive`-join (which would yield wrong columns and no `col_sum`). `hops fg lineage derived554160` consequently shows no upstream links — the missing capability is **lineage registration for a feature group populated from a computed query rather than a pure join.**
[agent] The platform is available, so no local `submission/derived554160.csv` was written (that fallback is gated on "if no platform is available").
